        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Lung geic mei zingbang khou,",
            "Guangh daihmei Jisu rui;",
            "Mi hei azanh e, azei hei tu-zangmei rui,",
            "Ata ning taan mak khang.",
            "",
            "Poubaomei lani mak,",
            "Zion pi lung khou tei;",
            "Khalou nimei makna,",
            "Siangding thing khou dup the.",
            "",
            "2. Zau lo, hei khou tei rui,",
            "Tatpat kan puni the;",
            "Nkhuaimei khang phulou,",
            "Poubaomei thanmei ta",
            "Rianra mei khou zailou.",
            "",
            "3. Latzan tei luai lana,",
            "Kalvary ching thang tei,",
            "Amuh daihmei nun le",
            "Rihmei bui sinmei le",
            "Poubaomei ta zai tat.",
            "",
            "4. Nzaeng mei Poubaomei,",
            "Rianra mei Kros phunga,",
            "Houmu nun rui zaina,",
            "Kalvary zuanna tat",
            "Khalou mei makna tat."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
